Minimize AI Credit usage.

Read only required files.
Avoid repository-wide searches unless requested.
Reuse existing project patterns.
Modify only files relevant to the task.
Do not rewrite unchanged code.
Stop when the requested task is complete.
Ask for missing context instead of making broad assumptions.


# AI Credit Usage Policy

Assume that non-interactive runs are expected to use a maximum of 10 AI credits.

Work accordingly:
- Keep AI usage as low as practical.
- Prefer incremental, focused changes over large, monolithic tasks.
- If the available AI credit budget is exhausted before completion, stop and report:
  - what was completed,
  - what remains,
  - and the recommended next step.
- Never assume the credit budget can be increased unless explicitly instructed.
